        "content": "You’re playing **Oxygen Not Included** and you spawned in a pretty standard starting biome. Good news: you’ve got clean water pools and algae nearby, so this is a solid start.\n\nHere’s **exactly what to do first and where**:\n\n---\n\n# ✅ Cycle 1–3: Immediate Survival Setup\n\n## 1️⃣ Dig out a central base area (right where you spawned)\n\nStay **around the Printing Pod** for now.\n\n- Dig out a **wide horizontal room directly below the pod**\n- Make it about **4 tiles high**\n- This will be your main base floor\n\nDon’t dig into:\n- The big water pool below yet\n- The darker biomes (they may contain slime/germs)\n\n---\n\n## 2️⃣ Build Outhouse + Wash Basin (Top Priority)\n\nPlace them **on the far left or right of your base floor**, NOT in the middle.\n\n**Build:**\n- 🧻 Outhouse (1 per 3 dupes)\n- 🚿 Wash Basin (set direction so they must pass it leaving bathroom)\n\nLayout example:\n\n```\n[Wall][Outhouse][Outhouse]\n        [Wash Basin]\n```\n\nMake sure dupes must walk past the basin after using toilet.\n\n---\n\n## 3️⃣ Build Cots (Sleep)\n\nPlace cots on the main floor for now.\nLater you’ll make bedrooms.\n\n---\n\n## 4️⃣ Build Manual Generator + Research Station\n\nPut this on the opposite side of your bathroom.\n\nBuild:\n- Manual Generator\n- Small Battery\n- Research Station\n\nConnect with wire.\n\nStart researching:\n👉 **Basic Farming**\n\n---\n\n## 5️⃣ Oxygen (VERY Important Soon)\n\nYou’ll soon need oxygen production.\n\nBuild:\n- 1–2 **Oxygen Diffusers**\n- Place them near the center of your base\n\nYou have algae nearby (the green stuff), so you’re safe early on.\n\n---\n\n# ✅ Cycle 3–10: Stabilize Food & Layout\n\n## 6️⃣ Start Mealwood Farm (Above Your Base)\n\nDig a room **above the Printing Pod**.\n\nMake it:\n- 4 tiles tall\n- Enclosed with doors\n\nPlant:\n- 5 Mealwood per duplicant\n\nYou already have dirt nearby, so you’re good.\n\n---\n\n## 7️⃣ Water Management\n\nDo NOT dig into the big lower water pool yet.\n\nInstead:\n- Use pitcher pump in the small clean pool near you.\n- Keep polluted water separate.\n\n---\n\n# ✅ Smart Early Layout Plan (From Your Map)\n\nBased on your screenshot:\n\n### ✅ Best base layout:\n- Top level → Farms\n- Middle → Printing pod / main hub\n- Below that → Bathroom + power\n- Lower → Storage\n- Very bottom → Water reservoir (leave natural pool for now)\n\n---\n\n# 🚫 What NOT to Do Yet\n\n- Don’t dig far into slime biome\n- Don’t open big water pockets carelessly\n- Don’t take more than 3 dupes early\n- Don’t ignore bathroom setup\n\n---\n\n# 🎯 Your Immediate Checklist\n\nRight now, in order:\n\n1. Dig base floor under pod\n2. Build outhouse + wash basin\n3. Build 3 cots\n4. Build manual generator + battery + research\n5. Start Basic Farming research\n6. Build oxygen diffuser\n\n---\n\nIf you want, tell me:\n- How many dupes you started with\n- Difficulty settings\n- Whether you want beginner-safe or optimized playstyle\n\nAnd I’ll give you a step‑by‑step 20-cycle plan 👌",
